              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 5-29 AKAP 组成通讯复合物启动细胞内亚细胞区室进行 PKA 系统的应答（引自 Karp，2010）。在这一机制中 AKAP 起支架作用，它将 PKA、PKA 的作用底物及磷酸酶都结合在同一个复合物中，既方便快速启动反应，又可快速使激酶失活。图中横式棒状结构是不同的 AKAP。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.505,
            0.872,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.505,
                0.872,
                0.84
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_20_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.211,
                0.845,
                0.739,
                0.861
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 5-30 霍乱毒素对 G 蛋白活性的影响（引自 Nelson and Cox，2013）。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.051,
            0.886,
            0.485,
            0.96
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "糖化了的亚基不能进行 GDP-GTP 的交换，从而阻断了  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "G_{i\\alpha}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  对腺苷酸环化酶的抑制，同样会引起 cAMP 的过量产生。百日咳杆菌通过呼吸道感染，在呼吸道中破坏了纤毛状上皮细胞（该细胞的正"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.885,
            0.945,
            0.96
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "常功能是清除黏液）。如果没有了这种纤毛细胞的作用，就必须通过严重的咳嗽来清理呼吸道。至于 G 蛋白缺陷是如何杀死纤毛细胞的，目前尚不清楚。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 21,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.055,
            0.289,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学（第二版）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.11,
            0.401,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3 PKC系统的信号转导机制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.147,
            0.496,
            0.221
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在 G 蛋白偶联系统的信号转导中，除了以 cAMP 作为第二信使外，某些信号分子作用于受体后，可产生磷脂酰肌醇作为第二信使，故此称为磷脂酰肌醇信号途径（phosphatidylinositol signal pathway）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.222,
            0.497,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在这一信号转导途径中，膜受体与其相应的第一信使分子结合后，激活膜上的Gq蛋白（G蛋白的一种），然后由Gq蛋白激活磷脂酶C-β"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.521,
            0.091,
            0.954,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(phospholipase C-β, PLC-β), 将膜上的磷脂酰肌醇二磷酸 (phosphatidylinositol biphosphate, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{PIP}_2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ") 分解为两个细胞内的第二信使: 二酰甘油 (diacylglycerol, DAG) 和肌醇三磷酸 (inositol triphosphate, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " )。"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 动员细胞内钙库释放 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 到细胞质中与钙调蛋白结合, 随后参与一系列的反应; 而 DAG 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的协同下激活蛋白激酶 C (protein kinase C, PKC), 然后通过蛋白激酶 C 引起级联反应进行细胞的应答。该通路也称 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、DAG、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 信号通路, 或称 PKC 系统 (protein kinase C system) (图 5-31)。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.297,
            0.93,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.108,
                0.297,
                0.93,
                0.603
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_21_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.274,
                0.612,
                0.764,
                0.627
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 5-31 激活蛋白激酶 C 的 PIP₂ 信号途径（引自 Plopper，2016）。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.066,
            0.661,
            0.495,
            0.697
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3.1 作用于PKC途径的信号、受体、G蛋白与效应物"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.709,
            0.497,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "如同 cAMP 信号转导途径，磷脂酰肌醇信号转导系统也是由三个膜蛋白组成:与 Gq 蛋白偶联的受体、Gq 蛋白和效应物。Gq 蛋白也是异源三体，其  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  亚基上具有 GTP/GDP 结合位点，作用方式与 cAMP 系统中的 G 蛋白完全相同。该系统的效应物是磷脂酰肌醇特异的磷脂酶 C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  (phosphatidylinositol-specific phospholipase C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , PI-PLC- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " )，此处的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  表示磷脂酶 C 的一种异构体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.066,
            0.859,
            0.497,
            0.933
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "作用于 PKC 系统的信号种类很多，包括乙酰胆碱、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -肾上腺素类似物、肾上腺素激动剂、血管生成素（angiogenin）、血管紧张素（angiotensin）、组胺、血小板衍生生长因子、加压素（vasopressin）等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.525,
            0.661,
            0.739,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3.2 第二信使的产生"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.524,
            0.69,
            0.955,
            0.8
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "磷脂酰肌醇信号途径的关键反应是  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "PIP_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  水解成两种第二信使: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和 DAG。由于该途径中的关键酶——蛋白激酶 C 的激活是 DAG 和  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  共同作用的结果，所以  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  是该途径的第三种信号分子，基本过程包括磷脂酶 C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的激活、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}/DAG"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的生成、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的释放。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.524,
            0.803,
            0.956,
            0.933
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）磷脂酶 C-β 的激活 磷脂酶 C-β 相当于 cAMP 系统中的效应物腺苷酸环化酶，也是膜整合蛋白，它的活性受 Gq 蛋白调节。当信号分子识别并与受体结合后，使受体激活。激活的受体由于构型的改变，细胞质面结构域与 Gq 蛋白结合，从而将 Gq 蛋白的亚基激活。激活的 Gq 蛋白 α 亚基上发生 GTP 与 GDP 的交换并导致结合有 GTP 的 α"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 22,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.765,
            0.056,
            0.895,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5 细胞通讯"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.913,
            0.055,
            0.939,
            0.068
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "155"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.055,
            0.092,
            0.485,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "亚基从 Gq 蛋白上释放出来，激活的 Gq 的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  亚基通过扩散与磷脂酶 C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  接触，并将磷脂酶 C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  激活。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.13,
            0.485,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）第二信使 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_3 / \\mathrm{DAG}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的生成 被激活的"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.513,
            0.092,
            0.944,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "磷脂酶 C- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  水解质膜上的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "PIP_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，产生  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和 DAG（图 5-32），这两种小分子具有第二信使作用，将细胞外的信号进一步放大。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.072,
            0.164,
            0.93,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.072,
                0.164,
                0.93,
                0.442
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_22_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.108,
                0.455,
                0.894,
                0.504
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 5-32 磷脂酶 C- "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  催化  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "PIP_{2}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  水解生成 DAG 和  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "IP_{3}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " （引自 Lodish et al., 2013）。 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "PIP_{2}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  是质膜上磷脂酰肌醇（phosphatidylinositol, PI）的衍生物，由 PI 激酶将 PI 磷酸化，生成 PIP，然后由 PIP 激酶将 PIP 进一步磷酸化，生成  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "PIP_{2}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 。激活的磷脂酶 C- "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  将  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "PIP_{2}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  降解成  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "IP_{3}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  和 DAG。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.057,
            0.521,
            0.487,
            0.688
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 启动第二信使 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的释放 由 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{PIP}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水解后产生的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 是水溶性的小分子，它可以离开质膜并迅速在胞质溶胶中扩散。"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 与内质网膜上特异的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 受体结合，使 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{IP}_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "-闸门 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 释放通道打开，使 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 从内质网中释放出来，导致细胞内 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 浓度瞬间增高。释放出的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 作为第二信使能够引起许多不同的细胞反应。最直接的作用有两个:第一是协同 DAG 激活蛋白激酶 C；第二是 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 与钙调蛋白结合引起细胞的其他反应。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.057,
            0.69,
            0.487,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "内质网上的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  受体是一种由分子质量为 260kDa 的糖蛋白组成的同质四聚体，4 个亚基组成一个穿膜的通道，每个亚基都有  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  结合的位点，当 3～4 个位点被  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  占据时，受体复合物构型发生改变，打开离子通道，储藏在内质网中的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  随即释放，进入胞质溶胶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.059,
            0.812,
            0.294,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3.3 蛋白激酶C的激活"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.84,
            0.488,
            0.932
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第二信使 cAMP 的作用对象是 cAMP 依赖性的蛋白激酶 A，而第二信使  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}/DAG"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的信号级联反应则要通过蛋白激酶 C（PKC），所以由  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}/DAG"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  进行的信号转导又称为 PKC 途径。这一途径中的关键步骤是磷脂酶 C 的激活。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.934,
            0.488,
            0.951
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "蛋白激酶C的激活涉及一系列复杂的反应过"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.516,
            0.52,
            0.947,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "程，是三种第二信使共同作用的结果。蛋白激酶C在非活性状态下是水溶性的，游离存在于胞质溶胶中，激活后成为膜结合的酶。蛋白激酶C的激活是脂依赖性的，需要膜脂DAG的存在，同时又是 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 依赖性的，需要胞质溶胶中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 浓度的升高。当DAG在质膜中出现时，胞质溶胶中的蛋白激酶C被结合到质膜上，然后在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的作用下被激活。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.516,
            0.671,
            0.948,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞质膜中的磷脂酶 C 被 Gq 蛋白激活后水解  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "PIP_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  生的 DAG 是脂溶性的，一直处于质膜中，为蛋白激酶 C 与质膜的结合提供了结合位点。而  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  生成后进入胞质溶胶，并作为内质网膜中  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  通道的配体与配体闸门通道结合，将  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  通道打开， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  从内质网中释放出来，为蛋白激酶 C 的激活创造了另一个必要的条件。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.517,
            0.811,
            0.755,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3.4 蛋白激酶C的作用"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.516,
            0.84,
            0.948,
            0.913
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "蛋白激酶 C 是一个家族或一类相关蛋白的总称，其中有些仅有第二信使（如 DAG）就可以被激活，有些则需要同时有  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  作为辅助因子才能被激活，这就是名称中 C 的含义。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.517,
            0.916,
            0.949,
            0.951
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "蛋白激酶 C 是将靶蛋白的丝氨酸和苏氨酸残基磷酸化的酶，如同蛋白激酶 A，蛋白激酶 C 也"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 23,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.067,
            0.056,
            0.094,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "156"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.056,
            0.281,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学（第二版）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.091,
            0.36,
            0.107
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "是属于多功能丝氨酸和苏氨酸激酶。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.057,
            0.11,
            0.487,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞内的蛋白激酶 C 有多种异构体，在细胞内有不同的组织定位、不同的靶蛋白，以及不同的作用。它们的靶蛋白包括细胞骨架蛋白、酶等，参与生化反应的调控，同时也能作用于细胞核中的转录因子，参与基因表达的调控。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.057,
            0.204,
            0.487,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "因此，蛋白激酶 C 家族具有十分广泛的细胞功能，影响神经脊免疫反应，以及调节细胞的分裂等。表 5-8 是某些通过激活蛋白激酶 C 进行的反应。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.061,
            0.327,
            0.485,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_caption",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.063,
                0.289,
                0.481,
                0.323
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "表 5-8 不同组织中通过诱导细胞质中 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "{\\mathrm{{Ca}}}^{2 + }"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 浓度提高引起细胞反应"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.061,
                0.327,
                0.485,
                0.508
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_23_table_6.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>靶组织</td><td>信号分子</td><td>细胞反应</td></tr><tr><td>胰腺</td><td>乙酰胆碱</td><td>消化酶的分泌(如淀粉酶、胰蛋白酶原)</td></tr><tr><td>腮(唾液)腺</td><td>乙酰胆碱</td><td>淀粉酶的分泌</td></tr><tr><td>血管或胃平滑肌</td><td>乙酰胆碱</td><td>收缩</td></tr><tr><td>肝</td><td>加压素</td><td>糖原转变成葡萄糖</td></tr><tr><td>血小板</td><td>凝血酶</td><td>凝血</td></tr><tr><td>肥大细胞</td><td>抗原</td><td>组胺分泌</td></tr><tr><td>成纤维</td><td>肽生长激素</td><td>DNA合成,细胞分裂</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.059,
            0.531,
            0.462,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.2.3.5 第二信使 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 及 CaM 蛋白激酶的作用"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.059,
            0.56,
            0.489,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "由  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "IP_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  动员释放到细胞内的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  作为第二信使，除了参与蛋白激酶 C 的激活以外，还可以与钙调蛋白结合，将钙调蛋白激活后进一步激活 CaM 蛋白激酶，激活 CaM 蛋白激酶在细胞的生命活动中具有重要作用，包括细胞分裂、分泌活动、内吞作用、受精、突触传递、代谢及细胞运动。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.059,
            0.673,
            0.489,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在静息状态的细胞中，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 浓度通常维持在非常低的水平。之所以如此，主要是因细胞质膜及内质网膜中钙泵的作用。质膜中的钙泵将钙离子输出到细胞外，而内质网膜中的钙泵将钙离子输入到内质网的腔。除了钙泵以外，某些细胞的质膜中还有"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na^{+}-Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 交换泵，将"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na^{+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 输入到细胞质，而将"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 从胞质溶胶中输出；此外，线粒体膜也能将钙离子运输到线粒体基质。对于大多数处于静息状态的细胞，通过钙泵的作用，可以将细胞质中的"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 浓度维持在大约"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\times10^{-4}\\mathrm{mmol/L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.06,
            0.86,
            0.491,
            0.952
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1) 钙调蛋白 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 能够作用的效应物有很多不同的类型。依据细胞的不同, 钙能够激活或抑制不同的酶或运输系统, 改变膜的离子通透性, 诱导膜的融合, 或者改变细胞骨架的结构和功能。钙离子的这些功能并不是通过自身的直接作用, 而是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.514,
            0.092,
            0.946,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "通过与一些钙结合蛋白（calcium-binding protein）的结合，其中有一种钙结合蛋白叫做钙调蛋白（calmodulin, CaM）。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.515,
            0.149,
            0.946,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "钙调蛋白只存在于真核生物中，从不同的动物、植物和真核微生物中分离的钙调蛋白都非常相似。钙调蛋白是水溶性的，存在于胞质溶胶中，是由148个氨基酸组成的单条多肽，分子质量为16.7kDa。钙调蛋白的外形似哑铃，有两个球形的末端，中间被一个长而富有弹性的螺旋结构相连，每个末端有2个 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 结合结构域，每个结构域可以结合一个 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，这样，一个钙调蛋白可以结合4个 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，钙调蛋白与 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 结合后的构型相当稳定。在非刺激的细胞中，钙调蛋白与 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 结合的亲和力很低，然而，如果由于刺激使细胞中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 浓度升高时， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Ca^{2+}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 与钙调蛋白结合形成钙-钙调蛋白复合物（calcium-calmodulin complex），就会引起钙调蛋白构型的变化，增强了钙调蛋白与许多效应物结合的亲和力。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.516,
            0.43,
            0.947,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " /钙调蛋白复合物的信号放大作用 在不同的细胞中，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " /钙调蛋白复合物可以与蛋白激酶、cAMP磷酸二酯酶及质膜中的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 运输蛋白等结合。在众多的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " /钙调蛋白的靶蛋白中，有一类特别重要的底物，称为 CaM - 蛋白激酶，这是一类依赖 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " /钙调蛋白的蛋白激酶（"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " /calmodulin-dependent protein kinase, CaMK）。结合有 "
            },
            {
